OL,3,GNEWSABank cashier outed by holiday
OL,4,Aphotos after stealing #8k is ordered to
OL,5,Apay back money
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was jailed for 16 years in May but
OL,8,Freturned to Caernarfon Crown Court for
OL,9,Fa Proceeds of Crime Act hearing, where
OL,10,Fthe court heard she benefited
OL,11,F#13,333.26 from her crimes - and had
OL,12,F#12,630 in assets.
